168
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:08,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My head's not a soccer ball, you know!</font>

169
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:14,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Now I see!</i></font>

170
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:16,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He needs his hands open</i>
<i>to use his powers...</i></font>

171
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:20,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That's why he can only do kicks!</i></font>

172
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:27,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>So if I can just do something</i>
<i>about those hands!</i></font>

173
00:14:27,290 --> 00:14:29,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Time for more kicking!</font>

174
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's 3 plus 4?!</font>

175
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:37,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't you know what
3 plus 4 is, you dummy?!</font>

176
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:38,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me think...</font>

177
00:14:38,570 --> 00:14:42,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">3, 4... 5, 6...</font>

178
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:44,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It worked!</font>

179
00:14:54,350 --> 00:14:57,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now, Kuririn!</font>

180
00:15:03,860 --> 00:15:08,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That moron, falling for such a stupid trick!</font>

181
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:17,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you? Now it's your turn!</font>

182
00:15:17,670 --> 00:15:19,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">16 plus 27!</font>

183
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:22,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">43!</font>

184
00:15:24,450 --> 00:15:27,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">9 minus 1!</font>

185
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">9?</font>

186
00:15:38,130 --> 00:15:42,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ring out! Kuririn wins!</font>

187
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:48,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The answer is 8!</font>

188
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:55,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Way to go, Kuririn! You did it!</font>

189
00:15:58,430 --> 00:15:59,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Well done.</i></font>

190
00:15:59,900 --> 00:16:03,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kuririn has really come around!</i></font>

191
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:18,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I should've given him math training, too!</font>

192
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:24,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's time for the 4th match
