193
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:31,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">First into the ring is Panputto!</font>

194
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:35,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There he is!</font>

195
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:05,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Panputto! Panputto! Panputto!</font>

196
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:08,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He certainly is showy.</font>

197
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:11,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His face seems plain, though...</font>

198
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:19,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Panputto here has won no less than
two world championships this year,</font>

199
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:23,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and is fighting in this tournament
