200
00:17:23,230 --> 00:17:27,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And now for his opponent,
Son Goku. Come on out!</font>

201
00:17:27,340 --> 00:17:31,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How naive. This tournament
is leagues beyond any others.</font>

202
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:36,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">At any rate, this will be a battle
of sheer experience and skill!</font>

203
00:17:36,170 --> 00:17:39,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I predict this to be an amazing match!</font>

204
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:45,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm impressed you didn't flinch.</font>

205
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:49,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Or maybe you didn't have time to?</font>

206
00:17:49,910 --> 00:17:52,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It didn't seem like a very strong punch.</font>

207
00:17:52,610 --> 00:17:54,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

208
00:17:57,150 --> 00:18:02,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah. It seems you have no idea who I am.</font>

209
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:05,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It wouldn't be nice to beat you right away,</font>

210
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:07,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I'll give you a little demonstration.</font>

211
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:10,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give me a little time.</font>

212
00:18:10,370 --> 00:18:13,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please keep it short.</font>

213
00:18:34,710 --> 00:18:37,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And we went through all
that trouble to rebuild it...</font>

214
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:40,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now it's easier to observe the match.</font>

215
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:44,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now do you realize
