216
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:44,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah!</font>

217
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:46,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's good.</font>

218
00:18:46,860 --> 00:18:49,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But he doesn't seem that strong...</font>

219
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:53,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just watch the match closely.</font>

220
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:54,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry for the wait!</font>

221
00:18:54,670 --> 00:18:58,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's get Match #4 underway!</font>

222
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:01,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">30 seconds.</font>

223
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:06,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry, but I'm going to win
