224
00:19:06,010 --> 00:19:08,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is a noteworthy match!</font>

225
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:14,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who will the winner be?
Panputto? Or Son Goku?</font>

226
00:19:14,190 --> 00:19:17,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the match begin!</font>

227
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:42,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-No way!</font>

228
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:46,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's unconscious?!</font>

229
00:19:46,730 --> 00:19:49,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son wins!</font>

230
00:19:49,340 --> 00:19:51,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a surprise!</font>

231
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:55,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who could've predicted that
