237
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That brat...</font>

238
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's no ordinary kid after all!</font>

239
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:24,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. He really may have
