241
00:20:27,950 --> 00:20:31,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Way to go, Goku!</font>

242
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:33,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I knew you'd win!</font>

243
00:20:33,490 --> 00:20:37,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He didn't look nearly as
