244
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:40,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe he wasn't feeling good today...</font>

245
00:20:40,990 --> 00:20:42,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I doubt that.</font>

246
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:46,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Panputto is definitely an incredible fighter,</font>

247
00:20:46,630 --> 00:20:50,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but only in terms of
comprehensible strength.</font>

248
00:20:50,570 --> 00:20:55,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's why he doesn't seem
