250
00:21:02,450 --> 00:21:07,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But Yamucha-<i>san</i> lost,
and he's about as good as me,</font>

251
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">plus I had a really hard time
