252
00:21:11,260 --> 00:21:13,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course you did.</font>

253
00:21:13,430 --> 00:21:18,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your opponents were great experts
with unbelievable strength as well.</font>

254
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:22,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>No matter who I face, I will not lose!</i></font>

255
00:21:47,530 --> 00:21:50,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

256
